<div class="title">
        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="org">
          Fifth Wheel Supper Club, LLC d/b/a Fifth Wheel &middot; Atlanta,
          Georgia
        </p>
        <p class="updated">Last updated 5 September 2026</p>
        <p class="lede">
          Please read these Terms carefully. They are a binding agreement
          between you and Fifth Wheel. They cover money, cancellations, conduct
          at the table, what we do with your information, and what happens if
          something goes wrong. Section 15 limits our liability and Section 17
          governs how disputes are resolved.
        </p>
