          </h2>
          <h3>Assumption of risk</h3>
          <p>
            You understand that Fifth Wheel arranges for you to meet strangers
            in person, and that meeting strangers carries inherent risk that no
            amount of verification eliminates. You choose to attend voluntarily
            and you accept that risk.
          </p>

          <h3>Disclaimer</h3>
          <p>
            The Service is provided on an &ldquo;as is&rdquo; and &ldquo;as
